          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TO FLOAT4\n\nThe To Float4 node converts ohter types to the float4 type. \nIt will use the incoming value for all components of the float4.\n\nFor example:  A float(5.3) into the To Float4 node will produce a float4(5.3, 5.3, 5.3, 5.3).\nWire will almost always implicitly convert to float4 for you, making this node very niche."
          }
        },
